{%- comment -%}
  =====================================================================
  BYMAN CYKLER - SNIPPET 1 OF 3: STATUS STRIP ("ÅBENT NU · LUKKER 16.00")
  =====================================================================
  WHERE IT GOES
    Password page, the FIRST section from the top.
    Add section -> Custom liquid -> paste ALL of this file into the
    "Custom Liquid" box. Leave Subheading, Heading and Text empty.

  WHAT YOU CHANGE HERE
    Nothing. The live text ("Åbent nu · lukker 16.00") is filled in by the
    script in snippet 2 (2-buttons-hours-contact.liquid), which reads the
    opening hours from its own table. So the hours are typed in ONE place.
    Without snippet 2, or if a visitor has JavaScript switched off, the
    strip simply says "ÅBNINGSTIDER" with an arrow and links to the hours.
    It never says "Åbent nu" unless the script has checked the clock.

  WHERE THIS CAME FROM
    Copied from the standalone page: build/index.html (A1 status strip)
    and build/styles.css (ui-spec.md section 6.4).
    All class names start with "bc-" so they can't clash with the theme.
    Theme colour and font variables (--color-scheme-text, --body-font-stack
    and so on) were seen on the Press demo store (theme 5.0.0) on
    2026-10-09, NOT yet in your own theme files. If a variable doesn't
    exist, the value after the comma is used instead (the measured Press
    value), so the strip still looks right.
  Comments like this one are not sent to visitors.
{%- endcomment -%}
